# Revitalizing Repast: "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. It gains indestructible until end of turn." On turn 2 Bot2
# Lightning Bolts Bot1's Llanowar Elves and Bot1 responds with the Repast: the Elves become a 2/2 and indestructible, so the
# Bolt's 3 damage (more than lethal) does not destroy them; they sit in play with 3 damage marked. The indestructibility
# lasts only until end of turn, the counter stays: on turn 4 a second Bolt kills the 2/2 Elves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Revitalizing Repast
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

